    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>Exposure to forces from beyond the stars have changed you.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers</div><p>Assign all the dice you rolled at the end of the background step to any of the following powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.7tvi62LlYMr2d8ho]{Cosmic}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.US0ZfFzUJ9CEcS6M]{Intuition}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Psychic powers category</p><p>• Select from Self Control powers category</p><p>• Select from Technological powers category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of these Yellow abilities, each using a different power:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.movHb6LASX4fCnKq]{Cosmic Ray Absorption}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.MBkLxSlHEUEemGtQ]{Encourage}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.ULudrAYmEjF6UQ2e]{Mass Effect}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Additional Info</div><p>Downgrade one d10 or d12 power one die size and upgrade one d6 or d8 power one die size.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Archetype</div><p>Roll d10, d8, d8 for archetype selection.</p></section>"
